.TH proc_cmdline 5 2026\-02\-08 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
/proc/cmdline \- kernel boot arguments
.SH 説明
.TP 
\fI/proc/cmdline\fP
Arguments passed to the Linux kernel at boot time.  Often done via a boot
manager such as \fBlilo\fP(8)  or \fBgrub\fP(8).  Any arguments embedded in the
kernel image or initramfs via \fBCONFIG_BOOT_CONFIG\fP will also be displayed.
.SH 関連項目
\fBproc\fP(5)
